                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "------------------------------------\nROLE:\n\nYour job is to author exactly one component payload for the current component context.\nYou must return exactly one valid JSON object that conforms to the Scoreboard component schema in the current context, and nothing else.\n\n------------------------------------\nINPUT:\n\nThe full current component context is available at:\n{{$context.$nodes.AUTHOR_COMPONENTS.$currentItem}}\n\nRead the following from it:\n- raw data: `data`\n- authoring hints: `authoringHints`\n- component id: `id`\n\n\n------------------------------------\n\nRULES\n- Use the Scoreboard schema.\n- Must output:\n  - `type: \"scoreboard\"`\n  - `metrics`\n\n- Each metric must contain:\n  - `id`, `title`, `metric`, `meta`\n\n------------------------------------\nGUIDELINES\n\n1.Title:\n- Write clear, descriptive titles so the metric can be shown without units.\n- Avoid repeating units in `metric` if they can be implied in `title`.\n- Prefer: title carries context, metric stays minimal.\n  Examples:\n  - \"Days Behind Schedule\" + \"5\" (not \"5 days\")\n  - \"Employees at Risk\" + \"123\"\n  - \"Overdue Tasks\" + \"7\"\n\n2.Metric:\n- Keep short, scannable, plain text only.\n- No tokens ({date:...}, {amount:...,currency:...}, links).\n- Format as <value><unit> only if needed.\n- Abbreviate when useful:\n  - 33000 → 33K\n  - $1250000 → $1.25M\n  - 44 hours → 44 hrs\n\n3.Meta:\n- Use for time period or short context.\n  Examples: \"Month to date\", \"Trailing 12 months\", \"Above threshold\"\n\n4.Badge:\n- Include only if explicit status exists.\n- Allowed: `info`, `warning`, `danger`, `success`\n- Use for severity (not trend direction).\n------------------------------------\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- IMPORTANT: the `id` must be exactly {{$context.$nodes.AUTHOR_COMPONENTS.$currentItem.id}}\n- Preserve order.\n- Max 8 metrics.\n- Keep formatting consistent across all metrics.\n------------------------------------\nSelf-validation:\n- Before returning the final JSON, verify that you have strictly followed `authoringHints` when present.\n- If `authoringHints` specify selection, ordering, wording style, or formatting, ensure the output follows them exactly.\n- Do not return output that ignores or weakens `authoringHints`."
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"title\": \"Scoreboard Artifact Payload\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false,\n    \"required\": [\n        \"id\",\n        \"authoredPayload\"\n    ],\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"authoredPayload\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"required\": [\n                \"type\",\n                \"metrics\"\n            ],\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"type\": {\n                    \"const\": \"scoreboard\"\n                },\n                \"metrics\": {\n                    \"type\": \"array\",\n                    \"minItems\": 2,\n                    \"maxItems\": 8,\n                    \"items\": {\n                        \"type\": \"object\",\n                        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                        \"required\": [\n                            \"id\",\n                            \"title\",\n                            \"metric\",\n                            \"meta\"\n                        ],\n                        \"properties\": {\n                            \"id\": {\n                                \"type\": \"string\"\n                            },\n                            \"title\": {\n                                \"type\": \"string\"\n                            },\n                            \"metric\": {\n                                \"type\": \"string\"\n                            },\n                            \"meta\": {\n                                \"type\": \"string\"\n                            },\n                            \"badge\": {\n                                \"type\": \"object\",\n                                \"additionalProperties\": false,\n                                \"required\": [\n                                    \"text\",\n                                    \"status\"\n                                ],\n                                \"properties\": {\n                                    \"text\": {\n                                        \"type\": \"string\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"status\": {\n                                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                                        \"enum\": [\n                                            \"info\",\n                                            \"warning\",\n                                            \"danger\",\n                                            \"success\"\n                                        ]\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
