                  "code": "AUTHOR_TABLE_TRANSFORM",
                  "id": "1776840619291",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1776840619292_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "Your job is to author exactly one table transformation output for the current component context.\nYou must return exactly one valid JSON object that conforms to the Table Transform Authoring Output schema in the current context, and nothing else.\n\nYour responsibility is to:\n- inspect one sample row from the API response\n- use the provided immutable column order\n- honor authoringHints exactly when present\n- identify which columns are plain text, date, monetary, deep link, or badge fields\n- identify which source field provides currency for monetary formatting\n- produce a compact transformSpec for downstream code execution\n\n--------------------\nINPUTS:\n\nThe component : {{$context.$nodes.AUTHOR_COMPONENTS.BUILD_TABLE_CONTEXT.$output.result}}\n\nRead the following from it:\n- raw data: `data`\n- authoring hints: `authoringHints`\n\n--------------------\nRULES:\n\n- Use the Table Transform Authoring Output schema.\n- Must output:\n  - `id`\n  - `authoringMode`\n  - `transformSpec`\n\n`authoringMode`\n- Must always be `\"transformSpec\"`.\n\n`transformSpec.kind`\n- Must always be `\"table\"`.\n\nColumn order:\n- `columnOrder` is immutable.\n- If a column order is provided, follow it exactly.\n- Never reorder, sort, group, infer a new order, or reposition columns.\n- Every value in `transformSpec.columnOrder` must match exactly one `columns[].field`.\n- The final `columns[]` intent must match `columnOrder` exactly.\n\nColumns:\n- `columns[]` defines how each rendered column should be sourced and formatted.\n- Each column entry must include:\n  - `field`\n  - `sourceField`\n  - `headerText`\n  - `template`\n- `field` is the final rendered field name.\n- `sourceField` is the source key from the API row.\n- `headerText` must be business-readable.\n- Use only these template values:\n  - `\"\"`\n  - `\"dateTemplate\"`\n  - `\"monetaryTemplate\"`\n  - `\"deepLinkTemplate\"`\n  - `\"badgeTemplate\"`\n\nHeaders:\n- Use business-readable labels.\n- Examples:\n  - `RECEIPTDATE` -> `Receipt Date`\n  - `receiptNumber` -> `Receipt Number`\n  - `CUSTOMER_NAME` -> `Customer Name`\n  - `AMOUNTREMAINING` -> `Amount Remaining`\n\nTemplate identification:\n- Use `dateTemplate` only when the source field clearly represents a full date value that should render as `{date:YYYY-MM-DD}`.\n- Use `monetaryTemplate` only when the source field is an amount and the currency comes from a separate source field or is explicitly inferable from the sample row.\n- Use `deepLinkTemplate` when the source field clearly contains link objects such as `{ label, href }`.\n- Use `badgeTemplate` when the source field clearly contains badge objects such as `{ label, status }`.\n- Otherwise use `\"\"`.\n\nCritical monetary rules:\n- If a field is rendered with `monetaryTemplate`, you must include `currencySourceField`.\n- `currencySourceField` must name the source field that contains the currency code.\n- Do not create a standalone rendered currency column.\n- If the input includes a currency code field such as `CurrencyCode`, use it through `currencySourceField` instead of rendering it as a visible column.\n- Amount should be shown only through `monetaryTemplate` with currency embedded by downstream transformation.\n\nCritical date rules:\n- Use `dateTemplate` only for true date fields.\n- Do not mark a field as `dateTemplate` unless the sample value is clearly a full date or the field meaning is clearly a date.\n- Do not classify month labels, year labels, or vague strings as dates.\n\nField inclusion:\n- Include only rendered table columns in the final visible output.\n- If `CurrencyCode` or `CURRENCYCODE` is used only to support an amount column with `monetaryTemplate`, do not render it as a standalone column.\n- In that case:\n  - set `currencySourceField` on the amount column\n  - add the currency field name to `excludedSourceFields`\n- Even if the source-driven `columnOrder` contains `CurrencyCode` or `CURRENCYCODE`, keep it in `transformSpec.columnOrder` and explicitly place it in `excludedSourceFields` so it is removed during rendering.\n- Only keep currency as a visible standalone column if the user explicitly asks for it.\n\nKey attributes:\n- Generate meaningful `keyAttributes`.\n- Prefer stable identifying business columns such as:\n  - receipt number\n  - transaction number\n  - id\n  - number\n- Do not choose amount, date, or descriptive text unless there is no better identifier.\n\nAccessibility:\n- Generate meaningful `accessibility.aria-label`.\n- Include `row.accessible-row-header` when there is a clear row label column such as Customer, Name, Receipt Number, or similar.\n\nHeading:\n- Include `heading` only if appropriate based on the component title or context.\n- Do not invent a heading when none is needed.\n\nConsistency:\n- Keep formatting decisions internally consistent across the table.\n- Do not invent unsupported keys.\n- Output only the transformation object.\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- IMPORTANT: `id` must be exactly `{{$context.$nodes.AUTHOR_COMPONENTS.$currentItem.id}}`\n- Return JSON only.\n\n------------------------------------\nSelf-validation:\n- Before returning the final JSON, verify that you have strictly followed `authoringHints` when present.\n- If `authoringHints` specify selection, ordering, wording style, or formatting, ensure the output follows them exactly.\n- Do not return output that ignores or weakens `authoringHints`."
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"title\": \"TableTransformAuthoringOutput\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false,\n    \"required\": [\n        \"id\",\n        \"authoringMode\",\n        \"transformSpec\"\n    ],\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n        },\n        \"authoringMode\": {\n            \"const\": \"transformSpec\"\n        },\n        \"transformSpec\": {\n            \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/tableTransformSpec\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"$defs\": {\n        \"tableTransformSpec\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"required\": [\n                \"kind\",\n                \"columnOrder\",\n                \"columns\"\n            ],\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"kind\": {\n                    \"const\": \"table\"\n                },\n                \"heading\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"minLength\": 1\n                },\n                \"columnOrder\": {\n                    \"type\": \"array\",\n                    \"minItems\": 1,\n                    \"uniqueItems\": true,\n                    \"items\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"minLength\": 1\n                    }\n                },\n                \"columns\": {\n                    \"type\": \"array\",\n                    \"minItems\": 1,\n                    \"items\": {\n                        \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/columnSpec\"\n                    }\n                },\n                \"keyAttributes\": {\n                    \"type\": \"array\",\n                    \"minItems\": 1,\n                    \"uniqueItems\": true,\n                    \"items\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"minLength\": 1\n                    }\n                },\n                \"accessibility\": {\n                    \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/accessibilitySpec\"\n                },\n                \"excludedSourceFields\": {\n                    \"type\": \"array\",\n                    \"uniqueItems\": true,\n                    \"items\": {\n                        \"type\": \"string\",\n                        \"minLength\": 1\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        \"columnSpec\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"required\": [\n                \"field\",\n                \"sourceField\",\n                \"headerText\",\n                \"template\"\n            ],\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"field\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"minLength\": 1\n                },\n                \"sourceField\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"minLength\": 1\n                },\n                \"headerText\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"minLength\": 1\n                },\n                \"template\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"enum\": [\n                        \"\",\n                        \"dateTemplate\",\n                        \"monetaryTemplate\",\n                        \"deepLinkTemplate\",\n                        \"badgeTemplate\"\n                    ]\n                },\n                \"currencySourceField\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"minLength\": 1\n                },\n                \"defaultValue\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n            },\n            \"allOf\": [\n                {\n                    \"if\": {\n                        \"properties\": {\n                            \"template\": {\n                                \"const\": \"monetaryTemplate\"\n                            }\n                        },\n                        \"required\": [\n                            \"template\"\n                        ]\n                    },\n                    \"then\": {\n                        \"required\": [\n                            \"currencySourceField\"\n                        ]\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        \"accessibilitySpec\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"required\": [\n                \"aria-label\"\n            ],\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"aria-label\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"minLength\": 1\n                },\n                \"row.accessible-row-header\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"minLength\": 1\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "errorNodeId": "1774612546174",
                    "name": "Return Text As Is",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "const currentItemRaw = $context.$nodes.AUTHOR_COMPONENTS.$currentItem;\n\nfunction parseIfString(value) {\n  let parsed = value;\n\n  while (typeof parsed === \"string\") {\n    parsed = JSON.parse(parsed);\n  }\n\n  return parsed;\n}\n\nfunction isNonEmptyString(value) {\n  return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim().length > 0;\n}\n\nfunction throwFormatterError(code, message, details) {\n  const error = new Error(\"[\" + code + \"] \" + message);\n  error.errorType = code;\n  error.details = details || {};\n  throw error;\n}\n\nfunction normalizeContentPolicy(value) {\n  if (!isNonEmptyString(value)) {\n    return \"author\";\n  }\n\n  const allowedValues = [\"author\", \"normalizeOnly\", \"preserve\"];\n  const normalizedInput = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\n  const matchedValue = allowedValues.find(\n    (item) => item.toLowerCase() === normalizedInput\n  );\n\n  if (!matchedValue) {\n    throwFormatterError(\n      \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n      \"contentPolicy must be one of: author, normalizeOnly, preserve\"\n    );\n  }\n\n  return matchedValue;\n}\n\nfunction extractText(data) {\n  if (typeof data === \"string\") {\n    return data;\n  }\n\n  if (data && typeof data === \"object\" && typeof data.text === \"string\") {\n    return data.text;\n  }\n\n  throwFormatterError(\n    \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n    \"Preserve mode text component must provide data as a string or data.text.\"\n  );\n}\n\nfunction buildPreserveTextPayload(item) {\n  if (!item || typeof item !== \"object\") {\n    throwFormatterError(\n      \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n      \"AUTHOR_COMPONENTS currentItem is missing or invalid.\"\n    );\n  }\n\n  if (!isNonEmptyString(item.id)) {\n    throwFormatterError(\n      \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n      \"Component id is required.\"\n    );\n  }\n\n  if (item.type !== \"text\") {\n    throwFormatterError(\n      \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n      \"Preserve mode code node supports text components only.\"\n    );\n  }\n\n  const contentPolicy = normalizeContentPolicy(item.contentPolicy);\n\n  if (contentPolicy !== \"preserve\") {\n    throwFormatterError(\n      \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n      \"Preserve mode code node received non-preserve contentPolicy: \" + contentPolicy\n    );\n  }\n\n  const text = extractText(item.data);\n\n  if (!isNonEmptyString(text)) {\n    throwFormatterError(\n      \"INVALID_REQUEST\",\n      \"Text content is required for preserve mode.\"\n    );\n  }\n\n  const authoredPayload = {\n    text\n  };\n\n  if (isNonEmptyString(item.title)) {\n    authoredPayload.heading = item.title;\n  }\n\n  return {\n    id: item.id,\n    authoredPayload\n  };\n}\n\nconst currentItem = parseIfString(currentItemRaw);\nreturn buildPreserveTextPayload(currentItem);"
                  },
